2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     31s later at +1.6 (the trail evaluated the 10:00 bar — which CLOSED BEFORE
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     entry — against today's lows-avg). Spot then fell 24040->23926 without us;
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     morning chop-gate (ER=0.01, range=70pt) then stood aside the rest of the day.
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]   + FIX A (SMA8 pre-entry bar): the SMA8(low) trail now NEVER acts on a 15m bar
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     whose CLOSE time (bar-start + 15m) is <= POS.entry_time. A fresh entry can no
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     longer be ejected on price action that happened before it was opened.
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]   + FIX C (SMA8 arm window): trail arms on bars-SINCE-ENTRY, not bars-of-day.
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     sma8_low_of_option() now averages only TODAY's closed bars that closed AFTER
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     entry and needs >= SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS_SINCE_ENTRY (1) of them. With 1 own bar
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     SMA8L == that bar's own low, so close(>=low) can't trigger -> first real
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     trigger needs >=2 own bars. SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS (4, bars-of-day) is now only
2026-07-08 04:40:14,880 [INFO]     the fallback when entry_time is unknown (state-load edge). NOT a BE-gate.
